OL,3,GNEWSASimple test saved my life, says
OL,4,Abowel cancer survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I received my bowel cancer
OL,7,Fscreening test through the post, I
OL,8,Fcompleted it straight away and I'm so
OL,9,Fglad I did."
OL,11,FTaras Daneliuk, 65, from Penwortham,
OL,12,Fsaid that decision ultimately saved his
OL,13,Flife.
OL,15,FThe screening test detected a tumour
OL,16,Fbefore he had noticed any symptoms and
OL,17,Fsubsequent investigations revealed
OL,18,Fcancer.
OL,20,FWithin two months, Daneliuk underwent
OL,21,Fsurgery at Royal Preston Hospital and,
OL,22,Fthree years later, is cancer free.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
